{"id":4087,"date":"2025-01-07T14:17:59","date_gmt":"2025-01-07T19:17:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=4087"},"modified":"2026-08-17T17:42:38","modified_gmt":"2026-08-17T21:42:38","slug":"epithalon-20mg","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/product\/epithalon-20mg\/","title":{"rendered":"Epithalon (20mg)"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2><strong>Epithalon Product Description<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:228;1410-1637\">Epithalon is a short synthetic peptide built from four amino acids in the sequence Ala-Glu-Asp-Gly. Its structure was modeled on the amino acid composition of Epithalamin, a pineal gland extract studied in gerontology research.<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"33:1-33:217;1639-1855\">As a defined tetrapeptide, Epithalon is well suited to analytical and mechanistic work. It is supplied as a filler-free lyophilized powder and reconstituted with a sterile solvent immediately before experimental use.<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:307;1857-2163\">The compound sits within the pineal and AEDG peptide research area, alongside related bioregulator compounds studied for cellular signaling and regulatory function.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:24;848-871\">Compound Specifications<\/h2>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6\" data-sourcepos=\"13:1-27:40;873-1386\">\n<table class=\"min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal\">\n<thead class=\"text-left\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">Property<\/th>\n<th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">Value<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">CAS Number<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">307297-39-8<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">PubChem CID<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">219042<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Molecular Formula<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">C\u2081\u2084H\u2082\u2082N\u2084O\u2089<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Molecular Weight<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">390.35 g\/mol<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Amino Acid Sequence<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Ala-Glu-Asp-Gly (AEDG)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Sequence Length<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">4 residues (tetrapeptide)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">IUPAC<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">L-alanyl-L-alpha-glutamyl-L-alpha-aspartyl-glycine<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Synonyms<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Epitalon, Epithalamin, AEDG peptide<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Source<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Synthetic<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Purity<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">\u226599% (HPLC)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Appearance<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Lyophilized white powder<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Solubility<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Soluble in water<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Storage<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">-20\u00b0C, protect from light<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<h2><strong>Epithalon Peptide Structure<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div>\n<p><strong><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone\" src=\"https:\/\/pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/image\/imgsrv.fcgi?cid=219042&amp;t=l\" alt=\"Epithalon peptide structure\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" title=\"\"><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Source: <a href=\"https:\/\/pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/compound\/219042#section=2D-Structure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PubChem<\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"51:1-51:34;3799-3832\">Research Applications<\/h2>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6\" data-sourcepos=\"53:1-58:103;3834-4324\">\n<table class=\"min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal\">\n<thead class=\"text-left\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">Research Area<\/th>\n<th class=\"text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold\" scope=\"col\">In Vitro Application<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Telomere biology<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Experimental systems measuring telomerase-associated activity and telomere-length metrics in cell-based models<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Gene expression<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Assays quantifying transcriptional changes in defined differentiation markers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Epigenetic regulation<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Molecular-modeling and binding studies of peptide and histone interactions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Peptide characterization<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)\/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top\">Analytical evaluation of tetrapeptide identity, sequence, and stability<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"60:1-60:24;4326-4349\">Storage and Handling<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"62:1-64:60;4351-4532\">\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"62:1-62:65;4351-4415\">Store the lyophilized compound at -20\u00b0C, protected from light.<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"63:1-63:57;4416-4472\">After reconstitution, store at 2-8\u00b0C and use promptly.<\/li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"64:1-64:60;4473-4532\">Maintain aseptic handling to preserve compound integrity.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:504;343-846\">Epithalon, also known as Epitalon, is a synthetic tetrapeptide with the amino acid sequence Ala-Glu-Asp-Gly (AEDG). It is produced through controlled solid-phase peptide synthesis and supplied as a lyophilized powder for stability during storage and handling. The compound is characterized in laboratory research examining telomere biology, gene-expression regulation, and pineal-linked signaling pathways. Each batch is third-party tested and ships with a Certificate of Analysis for research use only.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":22735,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"","footer-sml-layout":"","ast-disable-related-posts":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"default","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","astra-migrate-meta-layouts":"set","ast-page-background-enabled":"default","ast-page-background-meta":{"desktop":{"background-color":"var(--ast-global-color-4)","background-image":"","background-repea